      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART III, LINE 4B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>FORM 990, PART III, LINE 4B, STUDENT ENRICHMENT: ENRICHMENT CLUBS PROVIDED STUDENTS WITH THE OPPORTUNITY TO PARTICIPATE AND ENRICH THEIR LEARNING IN VARIOUS TYPES OF ACTIVITIES/EVENTS SUCH AS MATH, SCIENCE, ROBOTICS, ART &amp; DRAMA, FITNESS, ETC. SELF-FUNDED THROUGH PROGRAM REGISTRATIONS FOR EACH EVENT.</ExplanationTxt>
