      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART III, LINE 4C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>FORM 990, PART III, LINE 4C, CLASSROOM AND LED SUPPLIES: PROVIDED STUDENTS WITH MATERIALS NEEDED TO SUPPLEMENT THEIR LEARNING EXPERIENCE. FUNDING HAS ALLOWED STUDENTS THE OPPORTUNITY TO PARTICIPATE IN DEEP DIVES AND EXPLORATION CLASSES, MINDS IN MOTION, AND PROJECT LEAD THE WAY CURRICULUMS. DEEP DIVES AND EXPLORATION CLASSES ALLOW STUDENTS CHOICE ABOUT LEARNING MORE ABOUT TOPICS OF INTEREST SUCH AS CERAMICS, MUSIC, THEATER, VIDEO PRODUCTION, SEWING, ARCHITECTURE, INSECTS, ROBOTICS, 3-D ANIMATION, ETC. PROJECT LEAD THE WAY PROVIDES STUDENTS A STEM (SCIENCE, TECHNOLOGY, ENGINEERING AND MATH) BASED PROGRAM THROUGH ACTIVITIES, PROJECTS AND PROBLEM SOLVING CURRICULUM. THE MINDS IN MOTION PROGRAM TAKES PHYSICAL EDUCATION PARTICIPATION TO A WHOLE NEW EXPERIENCE.</ExplanationTxt>
